# LSan suppressions for Chained Engine
# Ignore internal .NET runtime leaks that occur during hosting/teardown
leak:libcoreclr.so
leak:libCoral.Native.a
leak:memfd:doublemapper

# GTK's AT-SPI accessibility bridge allocates process-wide state the first time
# gtk_init_check() runs and never frees it (by design - it lives for the process
# lifetime). Triggered via NFD_Init() -> gtk_init_check() in FileDialogs::Init(),
# which every integration test hits once through Application's constructor.
leak:atk_bridge_adaptor_init
